          "Redesigned chat: replies read as plain text in a centered column instead of boxed bubbles, tool calls show as a compact chip you can expand, and copy, pin and speed stats sit under each reply",
          "The message box floats at the bottom with a round send button, a tools on/off toggle and a stop button while generating. A new chat opens on a short greeting with the message box in the middle and suggestions that start a prompt",
