          "Fixed spacing that the old CSS reset was silently removing, which ran reply paragraphs together and left inline code without padding. Also fixed an empty bubble that appeared when a reply only called a tool",
          "On macOS the sidebar shows the translucent vibrancy. Settings › Appearance › \"Sidebar opacity\" (was \"Darkness\") controls how much shows through",
          "Models, Instances, Observability, Settings, the ⌘K model switcher, the welcome wizard, the About and quit dialogs and the notifications all use the Midnight look: quiet cards, sentence-case labels, numbers in Geist Mono, and one main button per view",
